/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
T(n, k) := binomial(2*n + 3, k + 1) + (binomial(2*n + 1, k)*(2*k - 2*n) + binomial(4, k)*(2*k - 3))/(k + 1) - kron_delta(1, k)$
for n:0 thru 12 do print(makelist(T(n, k), k, 0, max(4, 2*(n + 1))));

